_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1622508008:1":{"text":"나무줄기에는 또 무늬가 나 있었는데, 가까이서 보면 <style=\"highlight\">자애로운 할아버지의 얼굴</style>처럼 보였다네.","source_cn":"树干上还有一道道纹路，凑近了看，像一张<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5FDB24744870F9B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"거목을 직접 봤어?","source_cn":"巨树是你亲眼所见？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x85BA0FF4845C03EC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"거목을 직접 봤어?","female":"거목을 직접 봤어?","variant_male_record_index":"85297","variant_female_record_index":"85298","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1622508009:1":{"text":"피레이? 자기가 <style=\"highlight\">라이세움 아카데미의 교수</style>인데 숲의 독특한 숨결에 이끌려 왔다고 하더구먼.","source_cn":"皮瑞先生说，他是<style=highlight>莱希...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7073CA538E67D452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1622508010:1":{"text":"거대한 나무를 오랜 친구처럼 여기면서 그 말을 알아듣고, 성격도 이해한다고 했지.","source_cn":"他把巨树当老朋友，能听明白巨树的语言，懂它的脾气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F6B29D720A3762E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:1:2":{"text":"피레이는 누구야?","source_cn":"皮瑞又是谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBE32BB5412B506CC","v